# Public topic selection

## To publicTopicAllowed (topicName: Text) -> Bool:
    Repeat for allowed in ["All", "Mathematics", "Computer science", "Methods"]:
        If topicName is equal to allowed:
            Return true.
    Return false.

## Component ResearchSelection

State:
    Let topic be "All".

Actions:
    To choose (topicName: Text):
        If publicTopicAllowed(topicName):
            Set topic to topicName.

View:
    <div class="topic-selection">
      <div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="Research topics">
        <button id="topic-all" class="filter" on-click={choose("All")}>All</button>
        <button id="topic-mathematics" class="filter" on-click={choose("Mathematics")}>Mathematics</button>
        <button id="topic-computing" class="filter" on-click={choose("Computer science")}>Computer science</button>
        <button id="topic-methods" class="filter" on-click={choose("Methods")}>Methods</button>
      </div>
      <p id="selected-topic" class="badge" aria-live="polite">Selected: {topic}</p>
    </div>

Style:
    .filters {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 8px;
        margin: 24px 0;
    }
    .filter {
        padding: 8px 12px;
        color: #34505c;
        background: transparent;
        border: 1px solid #c9c6bc;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font: 700 11px/1 inherit;
        cursor: pointer;
    }
    .filter:hover {
        color: #f8f4e8;
        background: #153c4b;
        border-color: #153c4b;
    }
    .badge {
        padding: 6px 8px;
        color: #12687a;
        background: #e4f2f3;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font: 800 9px/1 ui-monospace, monospace;
        letter-spacing: .1em;
    }
    button:focus-visible {
        outline: 3px solid #16758a;
        outline-offset: 3px;
    }

## Test: Public topic selection mounts its honest initial state
    Mount ResearchSelection.
    Expect that the text of "#selected-topic" is equal to "Selected: All".
    Expect that the count of "button.filter" is equal to 4.

## Test: Public topic filters update mounted selection
    Mount ResearchSelection.
    Click "#topic-mathematics".
    Expect that the text of "#selected-topic" is equal to "Selected: Mathematics".
    Click "#topic-computing".
    Expect that the text of "#selected-topic" is equal to "Selected: Computer science".
    Click "#topic-methods".
    Expect that the text of "#selected-topic" is equal to "Selected: Methods".
    Click "#topic-all".
    Expect that the text of "#selected-topic" is equal to "Selected: All".

## Test: Topic choices stay within the public catalog
    For all booleans admitted:
        Let mutable choice be "Administrative controls".
        If admitted:
            Set choice to "Mathematics".
        Expect that publicTopicAllowed(choice) is equal to admitted.
